  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Resilience for Food-Vulnerable Households through FFA in Kassa &amp; Gedaref states</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is proposed to serve five localities in both Kassala and Gedarif states; in Kassala, the project will target Girba, New Halfa, and Telkok localities, and in Gedarif, the targeted localities will be Central, Gedarif, and East Galabat. The initiative will work with vulnerable communities that depend on agriculture and casual labour farming to meet their basic livelihood needs.</narrative>
  </description>
